give @s minecraft:written_book[minecraft:written_book_content={title:"The Far Gate",author:"Mira Salt-Hand",pages:["Ruk had one fear: that the rope would fray from the far side. So he cut a door in the sky, a long way out, and set a dragon to sit on the hinge.","'Not to keep them out,' he told the dragon. 'To make them earn the walk.' The dragon did not laugh. Dragons don't.","If the gate stands open now, someone earned it. Look past the island. The rope's far knots are out there, black and cold, and nobody has counted them."]},minecraft:lore=[{text:"Page 3 of 11, the Knotkeeper's chronicle",color:"gray",italic:0b}]]
